<title>POLAND: Polish food prices fall 0.2 pct in May 21-31.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices fall 0.2 pct in May 21-31.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices fell 0.2 percent in the May 21-31 period after falling 0.1 percent in the previous 10 days and were 0.3 percent higher than in the April 21-30 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>				   MAY 21-31  MAY 11-20    LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     -0.2	  -0.1	  0.3 (0.8)</p>
<p> Bread				0.1	   0.1	  0.7 (0.6)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -1.8	  -2.3	  0.6 (3.5)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.1	   0.2	  0.5 (0.6)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.2	   0.2	  1.0 (1.2)</p>
<p> Eggs				-1.8	  -2.8	 -7.9(-6.2)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on May 20.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
